e woodland creatures, wearing their beautiful garments)\n\nPrickles: Look upon us, my dear friends. We are a proud and stylish group, thanks to my dream and thy support.\n\nFriends: Prickles, thou hast done it! Thou hast become a seamstress and brought beauty and style to our woodland home.\n\nPrickles: Thank you, my dear friends. I could not have done it without thy help. Together, we have created a clothing line that will be remembered for generations to come.\n\n(All the woodland creatures dance and celebrate)": -1.4140625,
